<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Modi is traveling to Bastar in Chhattisgarh to celebrate Diwali with security forces, marking a public display of gratitude in an area once dominated by Naxalites. In Kashmir, a blast at a police outpost in Ghaziabad was claimed by a Kashmir-linked outfit, prompting an ATS investigation while only one local terrorist remains active. Manipur security forces are conducting search operations and holding fortnightly security reviews after a gunfight in Kangpokpi and a rally in Ukhrul demanding an end to ethnic violence. Naxalites in the Bastar Maoist belt have dumped 900 detonators and electronic equipment. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQdlZiUHVwdTAwanhTNzF5SGhYa2trUUhrR3d0YWdzMEJJVkZoY21CTnVQSDBkdmxqalhHQWpMTk5NbGFuOUFwRkw3RmlkODFqZmJsYkxXSy1HU3VtRXdlcDBSdV9TWmlzbUpJZmF4NnY3aC02SWhxQlN4UEJJTnVJemc1aVpxd3FpNldTaDVGQ0QwSk0tY080YXA5RzVXdkYzdkViQ1FqektzdklvRVNWaVl0QzdJeXU1cmRVMS03UnpxU0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Jagran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Statesman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rediff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBhb3E5R3A4WndVYUNmSHJMMWhtQWxWQUJkakZRcnNCemsyLUVzX2ZiNG50YTFodmZRTTloR1ItdU0wdHZPOUROamtranJNQ2FYakVfaVgwSnEta2htRDd3V0pvcHo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daijiworld&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Pioneer&